5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to plan this year's camp! To get us started, I want to check the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" Let's make this the best one yet!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see such enthusiasm, Mio. I would like to look into ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and the ""Attendance sheets for the away camps."" I hope we can all bond closely.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll check the ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty"" and the ""Lottery and application for public group bookings."" We need to be realistic about the workload and the availability of facilities.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know if we'll actually get some sleep this time! I'll check the ""Accounts from two clubs that went inland"" and the ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds."" Let's find somewhere awesome!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll look into the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and the ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets."" I want to make sure we have a clear understanding of the actual costs this time.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Since we've already picked our lists, maybe we should think about what we're actually looking for? I want to make sure the costs are fair for everyone! What do you guys think?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very thoughtful point, Mio. I believe it is also important to consider how the environment affects our relationships. I hope we can find a place where everyone feels welcome and included.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"We should prioritize efficiency. If the logistics are too demanding, the quality of the training will suffer. I want to ensure the burden of organization is distributed fairly and doesn't overwhelm any single person.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I agree! But we also need a place that's actually comfortable. If we're too tired to move, it's not an adventure, it's just a nap! Let's make sure the place is cozy and fun!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree that efficiency and comfort are important. However, we must be precise with the budget. I want to avoid any unexpected deficits, so I'll be focusing on the actual expenditure patterns from previous years.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I totally get that, Misaki! I just want to make sure no one feels cheated by hidden costs. Does anyone else think we should double-check how we handle last-minute cancellations too? That always seems messy!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"That is a practical concern, Mio. While we handle the logistics, let us not forget the heart of the camp. I hope we can choose a place that encourages the younger members to open up.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Focusing on the heart of the camp is fine, but we cannot ignore the operational reality. If the administrative burden is too high, the organizers won't be able to participate in that bonding.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"You're all being so serious! We need to make sure the place is actually cool to stay in. If the beds are uncomfortable, we'll all be grumpy! Let's find a spot that's both easy and exciting!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Excitement is fine, but we can't ignore the numbers. If the budget is miscalculated, the ""cool"" factor won't matter. I'll stick to my research to ensure we have a realistic financial foundation.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,You're all so focused! I love the energy. Let's just make sure we're all on the same page about the money and the fun. I can't wait to see what we find out!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Mio. It is a joy to see us all contributing our different perspectives. I look forward to seeing the results of our research and finding a place that brings us all closer together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Let's keep our focus on the data. Once we have the results from our research, we can make a rational decision that balances the budget, the facilities, and the workload. I'll see you all in the next round.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to find the perfect spot where we can all sleep like logs and wake up ready for a huge adventure! See you guys soon!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll be waiting for the results. Let's hope the data gives us a clear picture so we can make a decision that is sustainable for the club's finances. See you all soon.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
