35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, I found some really important stuff! It looks like transport costs vary a ton depending on where we go, and those whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits. That's a bit scary if someone cancels!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a bit worrying, isn't it? I've learned that our bonds grow strongest when we share the same sleeping quarters in the evenings. I also noticed some members haven't been attending our camps at all.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The public booking process is a nightmare. A nine-page application and a lottery system six months in advance are too risky. Also, self-catering takes hours of work daily, which is an unacceptable burden on the organizers.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I found out that inland centers can be super crowded, like eight people to a room! And the prefecture beds are 1,100 yen. We definitely can't have everyone grumpy from no sleep!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The transport costs are the biggest variable in our budget. Combined with the non-refundable deposits for whole-building lets, we risk a significant deficit if we don't plan the headcount and destination very carefully.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! If we go for a whole-building let and someone drops out, the rest of us have to pay for them. That doesn't seem fair at all! We need a way to handle that.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very fair point, Mio. However, if we prioritize only the cost, we might miss the chance to welcome those who have felt left out. We must find a balance that is kind to everyone.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Kindness is a goal, but it cannot override practicality. If we choose a destination with a complex booking process or heavy cooking duties, we are simply shifting the burden onto a few people. We need a low-maintenance option.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"But if we're all squeezed eight to a room, we'll be too tired to be kind or practical! We need a place where we can actually relax so we have energy for the training!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"If we prioritize comfort or bonding without a strict budget, we'll end up in the same position as last year. We need a destination where the costs are predictable and the risk of a deficit is minimized.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I totally agree with Misaki! But we can't just be strict; we have to be fair. If we pick a place with a flat fee, we need a clear rule for cancellations so no one gets stuck paying extra!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I understand your concerns, Mio. Perhaps we can find a place that is both affordable and encourages us to spend time together. It would be a shame if some members felt they couldn't join us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"We must avoid any option that requires a lottery or extensive paperwork. Similarly, we should prioritize facilities with catering. We cannot allow the organizers to spend their entire camp working in a kitchen.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"Catering sounds great, Ryuji! But we still have to think about the beds. If we're all crammed together and can't sleep, we'll be too grumpy to enjoy the food or the training!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"We need to be realistic. If we choose a destination that is too far, the transport costs will eat our budget. We should prioritize a local or low-cost option to ensure the club's finances remain stable.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you, Misaki! Let's go for something local to keep transport costs down. But please, let's agree on a fair way to handle the money before we book anything! I don't want any surprises!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,It is a relief that we are all thinking so carefully about this. Let us remember that the true value of this camp is the friendship we build. I hope we choose a place that welcomes everyone.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Friendship is a byproduct of a successful camp, not a substitute for planning. We must choose a destination that minimizes administrative stress and labor. If the organizers are exhausted, the camp fails regardless of the location.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I'm tired of all this talking about paperwork! Let's just pick a place that has good beds and yummy food so we can actually have an adventure without being zombies!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree that we need a decision. To protect the club's finances, we must prioritize a destination with low transport costs and predictable fees. Let's look at the options and choose the most fiscally responsible one.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
